  "- [Search for workspace objects](https://docs.databricks.com/aws/en/search)",
  "- [Explore database objects](https://docs.databricks.com/aws/en/discover/database-objects)",
  "- [External lineage](https://docs.databricks.com/aws/en/data-governance/unity-catalog/external-lineage)",
