  "",
  "SELECT * FROM main.default.lesson079_isolation_probe;",
  "```",
  "",
  "企业管理员可将同一模型扩展为 DDL；下列代码需要 `CREATE CATALOG`/`CREATE SCHEMA` 等权限，不是 Free Edition 必做项：",
  "",
  "```sql",
  "CREATE CATALOG IF NOT EXISTS sales_dev",
