  "git status",
  "git diff",
  "python -m pytest tests/test_order_quality.py",
  "",
  "git add src/order_quality.py tests/test_order_quality.py",
  "git diff --staged",
  "git commit -m \"Reject orders with missing customer IDs\"",
  "git push -u origin feature/order-null-check",
  "```",
  "",
  "预期：测试通过；`git diff --staged` 只显示这两个相关文件；commit 创建后 working tree 恢复干净；push 后 provider 可用 `feature/order-null-check` 对 `main` 发起 Pull Request。若测试命令不可用，可直接运行第009课的 `assert` 测试，但不能跳过验证。",
  "",
  "评审者取得远端状态并检查整条分支差异，而不只看最后一个 commit：",
  "",
  "```bash",
  "git fetch origin",
  "git switch feature/order-null-check",
  "python -m pytest tests/test_order_quality.py",
  "git diff origin/main...HEAD",
  "```",
  "",
  "如果 `main` 已前进，作者可在自己的 feature branch 中执行 `git fetch origin` 与 `git merge origin/main`。遇到 `<<<<<<<`、`=======`、`>>>>>>>` 时，理解两边业务意图后编辑成最终版本，重新运行测试，再 `git add` 和 `git commit`。不要用覆盖文件或强制推送来“消除”你尚未理解的差异。",
  "",
  "## 动手实验（Databricks Free Edition，25 分钟）",
  "1. 准备个人练习仓库。若当前 Free Edition 可配置 Git provider，克隆到自己的 Git folder；若暂不可用，在本地 Git 客户端完成同一步骤，再把最终 `.py` 文件上传到 Workspace Files。",
